<%--
Unified_Register_Api_Test - Behavioral test for jqhtml.register() unified registration API

Target: packages/core/src/component-registry.ts register() (lines ~349-389)

Verifies register() auto-detects the source type and delegates correctly:
  1. A compiled TEMPLATE object (__jqhtml_template: true) -> register_template()
  2. A CLASS extending Jqhtml_Component (__jqhtml_component: true, no
     static component_name) -> register_component() using the class name
  3. A CLASS with static component_name set -> register_component() using
     that explicit name instead of the class name

DATA: none - this component drives its own assertions from on_ready() and
writes PASS/FAIL results into the DOM + console.
--%>
<Define:Unified_Register_Api_Test>
  <h1>Unified Register API Test</h1>
  <div $sid="status"></div>
  <div $sid="results"></div>
</Define:Unified_Register_Api_Test>
